== 4. refusals
no-argument: rc=1 ⛔ usage: polaris new [--retire <map>] <draft.md> [<draft.md>…] | stdout empty | ref unmoved
no-such-file: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/missing.md: no such file | stdout empty | ref unmoved
in-the-board: rc=1 ⛔ new: ops/board/ready/T-010.md: is inside ops/board/ — a draft lives outside the board | stdout empty | ref unmoved
no-frontmatter: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/nofm.md: no frontmatter — the first line must be --- | stdout empty | ref unmoved
no-title: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/notitle.md: title: is empty | stdout empty | ref unmoved
points-8: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/p8.md: steps: a card over 5 points lists its steps (2 or more, each 1-5 points) | stdout empty | ref unmoved
no-plan: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/noplan.md: plan: is empty — every task names the plan it belongs to | stdout empty | ref unmoved
odd-risk: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/risk.md: risk: must be normal or high (got medium) | stdout empty | ref unmoved
owns-nothing: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/noown.md: files_owned: lists nothing | stdout empty | ref unmoved
