bad-id: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/badid.md: id: X-1 is not T-<number> | stdout empty | ref unmoved
taken-id: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/taken.md: id: T-009 is taken | stdout empty | ref unmoved
taken-in-call: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/p60b.md: id: T-060 is taken | stdout empty | ref unmoved
unknown-dep: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/nodep.md: depends_on: T-404 is no task on the board | stdout empty | ref unmoved
steps-none: rc=1 ⛔ new: .polaris/drafts/ns13.md: steps: a card over 5 points lists its steps (2 or more, each 1-5 points) | stdout empty | ref unmoved
